e": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [5, 12], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "size": [724.0121459960938, 531.2816772460938], "pos": [-161.87742614746094, -649.7701416015625], "widgets_values": ["\nAn angular, 3d art style, with brush stroke color texture.\nA cinematic Krea2 trailer still on a quiet countryside road shoulder at dusk. The camera is directly above Oli and Jane, looking downward from high overhead at a steep near-vertical top-down angle, but close enough that their faces are readable; because the camera is above them, Oli looking up at the sky makes him appear to look directly into the camera lens or just slightly above it. This is a close overhead two-person composition, framing both standing characters from the tops of their heads down to about chest or waist level, with dusty asphalt, roadside dirt, flattened grass, small stones, and hedgerow shadows visible around their feet. Both characters are standing upright. Oli stands slightly left of center, not collapsed, not kneeling, not lying down, body close to Jane, chin lifted high, neck extended, face pointed upward toward the sky and the overhead camera, eyes open and aimed straight up into the lens direction. Oli's expression is calm, serious, and certain, with lips slightly parted as if quietly saying \"This world isn't real\"; there is no subtitle, no caption, and no visible text anywhere in the image. Jane stands close on the right, also upright, not holding Oli, looking at Oli's upturned face with shock and confusion, one hand half-raised near him as if she is unsure whether to stop him or reach for him. Oli is a 32-year-old mixed-race Black man with warm medium-brown skin, lean athletic build, short dense natural black afro shaped like a rounded cap of tight curls with slightly tapered sides, high forehead, strong dark eyebrows, deep brown almond-shaped eyes, long straight narrow nose bridge, defined cheekbones, slim serious mouth, subtle jaw stubble, wearing a dark navy oversized hooded sweatshirt with the hood bunched behind his neck and dark charcoal trousers. Jane is a woman in her 30s with fair natural skin, shoulder-length dark brown hair in soft waves, hazel eyes, wearing a cream blouse under a tailored camel blazer, dark navy tailored trousers, and a delicate silver necklace. Oli's upturned eyes are the key visual detail: both eyes clearly reflect the sky above him as a divided world, with one half of each eye reflection showing normal orange-violet dusk clouds and warm countryside light, and the other half showing blue-gold base-reality wireframe grid, glowing lattice lines, and small digital mosaic seams. The real environment around them remains mostly normal and physical, with only a few subtle blue-gold hairline cracks in the asphalt near Oli's shoes and a few barely hovering pebbles or grass blades. The half-glitched world should be visible mainly inside Oli's eye reflections, not as a full landscape transformation. No secret service agents, no soldiers, no cars, no tactical vehicles, no chasers, no crowds, no explosions, no large collapse effects, no on-screen text. The mood is intimate, ominous, and quiet: direct overhead close standing two-shot, Oli looking straight up toward the sky and camera, Jane shocked beside him, countryside dusk realism, precise eye reflection of a half-real and half-blue-gold-glitched world.\n"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 14, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 6, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "title": "Positive Prompt", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.24.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [